          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Delfador",
            text: _("Serves them right, preying on innocent travelers... Now, where’s these guides of yours we’re going to meet?"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "$companion_id",
            text: _("Umm... you know what, I’m thinkin’ we’re better off hunting them saurians all on our lonesomes instead. I’m still gettin’ paid after all this, right?"),
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:store_unit",
