          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:scenario_move",
            id: "Delfador",
            x: "$delfadorX",
            y: "$delfadorY",
            raw: "yes",
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:fire_event",
            event: "branch_if_259",
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Delfador",
            text: _("...decades ago, an elvish seer told me about <i>“the dark swamp”</i>, and that I must <i>“endeavour to bestow not destruction with that fire that I possess, but the gleaming light of truth instead.”</i> Surely this was not the event that she referred to?"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Delfador",
            text: _("Garard thinks little of such superstition, but I have done my best to follow that cryptic advice. Yet I confess I understand precious little of what she was trying to say. Why must seers always speak in riddles? It is hard to think clearly, especially in times of crisis..."),
          },
        ],
      },
